---

## 🔄 Workflow Steps

1. **Schedule Trigger** – runs daily
2. **HTTP Request (Reddit)** – fetch trending/viral post
3. **Set / Code Node** – extract & clean the topic
4. **OpenAI Node (ChatGPT)** – generate caption & image prompt
5. **OpenAI Node (DALL·E 3)** – create image (binary)
6. **HTTP Node (Cloudinary Upload)** – upload binary + store URL
7. **Code Node (Cleaner)** – keep only caption + `secure_url`
8. **Facebook Graph API Node** – publish post

---

